    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "21+ only. Limit 1 per customer. Goodie bags available while supplies last. Play 10/1–10/31. Redeem completed cards in-store 10/31–11/04. To validate a BUZZY’s Besties visit, show your receipt at BUZZY or on delivery. Follow"
